<title>USA: Celestial Seasonings sets buyback program.</title>
<headline>Celestial Seasonings sets buyback program.</headline>
<dateline>BOULDER, Colo. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Celestial Seasonings Inc said its board has authorized up to a $12 million repurchase of its shares of common stock in open market transactions, including block purchases, or in privately negotiated transactions.</p>
<p>Celestial currently has about 4.1 million shares outstanding. The stock may be purchased from time to time as the company's financial condition and market conditions permit.</p>
<p>The company said the buyback program does not include specific price targets and may be suspended at any time.</p>
</text>
